*

!.gitignore
!eval_samples.jsonl

# Track the Retriever knowledge base: it freezes the exact Wikipedia snippets the
# T4 runs retrieved from (rebuilding with `uv run kb` may fetch drifted articles).
# Must un-ignore the parent dir before the file — git won't re-include a file
# whose dir is excluded. Everything else under data/ is regenerated by the
# preprocessing scripts (`uv run preprocess` / `uv run socrateach`) or produced
# by training/evaluation runs.
!preprocessed/
preprocessed/*
!preprocessed/math_kb.jsonl
